@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:6002
# @baseUrl = https://indiamart-scraper.omkar.cloud

# Every value below returned a 200 with data on 2026-10-05 (local service).
# derive_facts.py reads the FIRST request per path as the proven example.

### Search Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/indiamart/products/search?query=cnc%20machine

### Search Products (city + business type + price range)
GET {{baseUrl}}/indiamart/products/search?query=basmati%20rice&city=Mumbai&business_type=exporter&min_price=50&max_price=120

### Search Products (large, long-registered suppliers only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/indiamart/products/search?query=industrial%20valves&annual_turnover=above_5_crore&gst_registration_age=above_3_years

### Search Suppliers
GET {{baseUrl}}/indiamart/suppliers/search?query=cnc%20machine

### Search Suppliers (city + business type)
GET {{baseUrl}}/indiamart/suppliers/search?query=led%20lights&city=Pune&business_type=manufacturer

### Autocomplete (search keywords)
GET {{baseUrl}}/indiamart/autocomplete?query=cnc&limit=10

### Autocomplete Cities
GET {{baseUrl}}/indiamart/cities/autocomplete?query=pun&limit=10

### Autocomplete Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/indiamart/categories/autocomplete?query=cnc&limit=10

### Categories (industries)
GET {{baseUrl}}/indiamart/categories

### Categories (sub-categories of an industry)
GET {{baseUrl}}/indiamart/categories?parent=agro-farm

### Categories (categories of a sub-category, by link)
GET {{baseUrl}}/indiamart/categories?parent=https://dir.indiamart.com/indianexporters/ac-refrigeration-equipment.html

### Category Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/indiamart/categories/details?category=cnc-machines

### Category Details (by name)
GET {{baseUrl}}/indiamart/categories/details?category=Basmati%20Rice

### Category Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/indiamart/categories/products?category=cnc-machines

### Category Products (city + business type)
GET {{baseUrl}}/indiamart/categories/products?category=cnc-machines&city=Pune&business_type=manufacturer

### Category Products (city listing link)
GET {{baseUrl}}/indiamart/categories/products?category=https://dir.indiamart.com/new-delhi/basmati-rice.html

